        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hello,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>i'm new in this Comic Multiverse, a game master and i played the free to play issues. One of my playergroups (i have 3 at the moment) managed to get stuck into the void with a selfcreated atombomb. The purpouse of the bomb was to destroy the crystal in the second issue, before they entering the portal, so I allowed it (they didn't know about the crystal, but they know about a strong power). They also managed to get Visonary get stucked with them in the void, because of the great succes I allowed that to (They want her to help them there, she attacked everyone because she was furious after this decision). After they destroyed the crystal, without the bomb, I made up a portalstream from the void into the three regions (russia, egypt, isla). The heroes didn't know where this portalstreams are going and just feel the regions temperature (cold, hot, warm). The partymember with the bomb decided it's for the best to activate and throw the bomb into the cold stream. He want to get rid of the bomb, so it can't explode with them. And now the bomb will be explode in russia. I will play the egypt part normaly, but I'm not sure about the rest. Because I think my heroes have to face the consequences, but will I start a nuclear war between russia and america or not? I mean I don't know this gameworld good enought to know what are the consequences of such act. And I know the heroes did'nt intend to do evil. But I think something should happen. I will gladly make my own issues for that, but I want to ask for advice or some references to the world and the worlds behavior. Thank you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tl,dr:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>My heroes drop accidentally an atombomb into a portal to russia, how to proceed?</p>",
