      {
        "id": 230171,
        "name": "Cult of Gloom",
        "username": "Cult_of_Gloom",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cult_of_gloom/{size}/1878_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-03-29T23:02:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Alright, here is how i would do it.</p>\n<p>Normally in issue taking place in Russia, there is a chance of a nuclear detonation from the power plant. I would change it so that there is now a chance of nuclear detonation from the bomb coming though the portal.</p>\n<p>When the player tossed the about to explode bomb into the portal going to russia, it didn't come out of the portal on the other side right away because the depleted OblivAeon shards is making the portal all weird. But it is going to come out of the portal at some time in the future. And looking though the portal they just came out of, that time is going to be soon, because they can see the bomb following them.</p>\n<p>So the players need to get to the OblivAeon shard and deal with it which will let the Visionary or whoever close the portal and have the bomb go off in the Void.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:06.587Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
